我很喜欢当你"嬷嬷"的感觉
I enjoyed being your bubby.

530
00:20:37,540 --> 00:20:38,720
我想你错了  麦克斯
I guess you were wrong, Max.

531
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:40,740
你和我还有家  我们就是彼此的家人
You and I do have family--each other.

532
00:20:41,180 --> 00:20:43,880
没上过法院  互相指控对方是杀人凶手前
We're not family until we have to testify against each other

533
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:44,960
我们当不了真正的家人
in a manslaughter trial.

534
00:20:47,980 --> 00:20:49,060
来  吃吧
Here, eat this.

535
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:50,820
我不想你染上我的病
I don't want you to catch what I just had.

536
00:20:51,100 --> 00:20:52,040
不可能的  麦克斯
Not gonna happen, Max.

537
00:20:52,220 --> 00:20:53,020
我听了你的话
I took your advice.

538
00:20:53,120 --> 00:20:54,000
硬起
I manned up.

539
00:20:54,080 --> 00:20:55,500
跟病魔单挑
I stared germs in the face.

540
00:20:55,820 --> 00:20:58,380
没错  你生病  我生猛
That's right, when you got sick, I got balls.

541
00:20:58,430 --> 00:20:59,909
姐牛吧
Booyah!

542
00:21:01,600 --> 00:21:03,200
简直跟我一模一样
Like looking in a mirror.
